<title>INDIA: Indian Aug cement output rises to 6.26 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Indian Aug cement output rises to 6.26 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian cement production rose in August to 6.26 million tonnes from 5.45 million in the same month in 1995, the government said on Monday.</p>
<p>    CEMENT PRODUCTION    Aug 96	Aug 95	  Apr-Aug</p>
<p>								1996     1995</p>
<p>				 6,263	 5,449     31,852   28,008</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary.</p>
</text>
